# Splash Portal draws a card "if that creature is a Bird, Frog, Otter, or Rat". A Bird (Plumecreed Escort, turn 3) and a Rat (Shoreline
# Looter, turn 5) each draw one card, so every creature type of the list but Frog is covered here (Frog and Otter in other scenarios).
# Lotus and two Moxen pay for both creatures on turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Plumecreed Escort
Shoreline Looter
Splash Portal
Splash Portal
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Plumecreed Escort.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shoreline Looter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Splash Portal.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Plumecreed Escort)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Splash Portal.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Shoreline Looter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

